Package: hostnur
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Hostnur <maintainer@hostnur.dev>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, nginx, php8.3-fpm, php8.3-cli, php8.3-sqlite3, php8.3-mbstring, php8.3-xml, php8.3-curl, php8.3-zip, php8.3-intl, sqlite3, python3, hostnur-agent (= __VERSION__)
Recommends: certbot, mariadb-server
Homepage: https://github.com/maelzx/hostnur
Description: Hostnur control panel
 Web control panel (Laravel/Livewire) served by nginx + PHP-FPM under a dedicated
 unprivileged user. Manages applications, databases, TLS and the host through the
 privileged Hostnur agent. Single-host, operator-administered.
